WEBVTT

00:00:08.758 --> 00:00:29.000
Chapter One. The Boy Merlin.

00:00:29.100 --> 00:00:38.700
Young Merlin lives in a castle with his mother, Princess Adhan.

00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:46.825
The castle is in Wales, in the west of King Vortigern's kingdom.

00:00:46.885 --> 00:00:51.166
Merlin doesn't know his father.

00:00:51.226 --> 00:00:56.108
He's fighting for the king far away.

00:00:56.168 --> 00:01:00.709
The castle is near a forest.

00:01:00.769 --> 00:01:05.474
Merlin and his mother often walk there.

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:10.408
She teaches him about forest plants.

00:01:10.468 --> 00:01:15.059
"When you're older, you can come here without me,"

00:01:15.119 --> 00:01:19.080
she says. "But be careful.

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:27.832
There are many hunters. And an enchantress, Ceridwen, lives here, too."

00:01:27.892 --> 00:01:33.588
Merlin's only friend is a toad.

00:01:33.648 --> 00:01:39.746
One day, Merlin visits the village near the castle.

00:01:39.806 --> 00:01:46.480
Two boys, Morfran and Arwel, are behind him.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:51.052
But Merlin doesn't see them.

00:01:51.112 --> 00:01:55.014
He talks to his toad.

00:01:55.074 --> 00:01:59.126
"Merlin's talking to his toad!"

00:01:59.185 --> 00:02:01.857
Morfran laughs.

00:02:01.917 --> 00:02:03.686
"Go away,"

00:02:03.746 --> 00:02:05.724
Merlin says.

00:02:05.784 --> 00:02:10.856
"Or when my father comes back home..." "We're not afraid, Merlin.

00:02:10.916 --> 00:02:13.736
Your father's never at home,"

00:02:13.796 --> 00:02:15.607
Arwel says.

00:02:15.667 --> 00:02:18.898
"And is he truly your father?

00:02:18.957 --> 00:02:23.169
Perhaps you're a demon's child!"

00:02:23.228 --> 00:02:29.246
That night, Merlin tells his mother everything.

00:02:29.306 --> 00:02:42.390
"What can I do about these boys?" he asks.

00:02:43.450 --> 00:03:05.000
Chapter Two. The Bullies Come Back.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:08.434
"I can talk to those bullies,"

00:03:08.494 --> 00:03:11.067
Princess Adhan says.

00:03:11.126 --> 00:03:14.969
"No," Merlin answers.

00:03:15.029 --> 00:03:19.102
"They call me a ‘mother's boy’ without that!"

00:03:19.162 --> 00:03:24.475
"Then your father can speak to them after he comes home."

00:03:24.535 --> 00:03:26.516
She smiles.

00:03:26.576 --> 00:03:29.748
"But be careful with Morfran.

00:03:29.808 --> 00:03:34.636
He's Ceridwen's son."

00:03:34.696 --> 00:03:43.418
Next week, Merlin goes to the village shop with his mother.

00:03:43.478 --> 00:03:50.312
He sits near the door with his toad in his hand.

00:03:50.372 --> 00:03:58.008
Suddenly, Morfran and Arwel jump out in front of him.

00:03:58.068 --> 00:04:02.260
"It's Merlin and his toad!"

00:04:02.320 --> 00:04:04.341
they cry.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:07.822
The toad is afraid.

00:04:07.882 --> 00:04:11.165
It falls to the ground.

00:04:11.225 --> 00:04:14.989
"Let's see your toad jump!"

00:04:15.048 --> 00:04:17.811
Morfran laughs.

00:04:17.871 --> 00:04:21.534
He runs after it.

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:29.266
When Merlin's mother arrives, the bullies leave.

00:04:29.326 --> 00:04:37.432
That night, Merlin sees his father in a dream.

00:04:37.492 --> 00:04:46.624
He is sitting under an oak tree after a fight with the king's enemies.

00:04:46.684 --> 00:04:51.744
"I'm dying," Merlin's father tells him.

00:04:51.804 --> 00:04:58.036
"Father, no! I need your help with some bullies!"

00:04:58.096 --> 00:05:00.340
Merlin cries.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:04.445
"When they bully you, walk away,"

00:05:04.505 --> 00:05:10.559
his father says. "Look for the biggest oak in the forest.

00:05:10.618 --> 00:05:14.971
There's something important near it."

00:05:15.031 --> 00:05:22.485
Next morning, Merlin tells his mother about the dream.

00:05:22.545 --> 00:05:25.316
"Listen to your father,"

00:05:25.376 --> 00:05:36.953
she says quietly. When Merlin meets the bullies again, they take his toad.

00:05:37.013 --> 00:05:43.200
"Say goodbye to Mr Toad!" Morfran laughs.

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:52.496
Merlin remembers his dream and walks into the forest.

00:05:52.556 --> 00:06:00.044
He lives there for days and eats forest plants.

00:06:00.104 --> 00:06:09.044
Then one day, he finds the biggest oak in the forest.

00:06:09.104 --> 00:06:13.444
There's a little house near it.

00:06:13.504 --> 00:06:18.796
In front of the house, there's a boy.

00:06:18.856 --> 00:06:22.766
He's sitting near a cauldron.

00:06:22.826 --> 00:06:35.000
"Who's that?" Merlin thinks.

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:58.650
Chapter Three. Ceridwen's Magic Potion.

00:06:58.710 --> 00:07:04.400
Merlin watches the house from behind the oak tree.
 
00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:10.862
"Morfran!" a woman cries through the open window.

00:07:10.922 --> 00:07:15.173
"Yes, Mother," the boy says.
 
00:07:15.293 --> 00:07:19.985
The woman comes out of the house.

00:07:20.045 --> 00:07:25.137
"Oh no!" Merlin thinks.
 
00:07:25.197 --> 00:07:31.670
"It's Morfran, and his mother — the enchantress Ceridwen."
 
00:07:31.730 --> 00:07:41.994
"Is the potion ready?" Ceridwen asks. "Soon, Mother," Morfran answers.
 
00:07:42.054 --> 00:07:51.296
"This potion can give magic powers to the first drinker of it!" she cries.
 
00:07:51.356 --> 00:08:00.110
"And that is you, my son!" Morfran smiles.
 
00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:03.631
"I need to find a bottle.

00:08:03.691 --> 00:08:08.073
Then you can drink the potion from it.

00:08:08.133 --> 00:08:17.116
We must do it quickly, before your father comes home," Ceridwen says.
 
00:08:17.176 --> 00:08:22.397
She goes back into the house.

00:08:22.457 --> 00:08:32.223
Merlin moves nearer, but Morfran doesn't see him.
 
00:08:32.282 --> 00:08:39.926
Just then, Morfran takes something out of a little bag.

00:08:39.986 --> 00:08:50.943
"Oh, no!" Merlin thinks. "It's my toad! Ha! Ha!" Morfran laughs.
 
00:08:51.003 --> 00:08:54.874
"Here's one more thing for the potion!"

00:08:54.934 --> 00:08:59.565
"Stop!" Merlin cries.
 
00:08:59.626 --> 00:09:05.978
He jumps out and takes the toad from Morfran.

00:09:06.038 --> 00:09:14.069
But at the same time, he hits the cauldron with his leg.

00:09:14.129 --> 00:09:19.419
It goes over onto the ground.

00:09:19.479 --> 00:09:25.910
Some of the potion falls onto Merlin's hand.

00:09:25.970 --> 00:09:31.751
"Merlin!" Morfran cries angrily.
  
00:09:31.811 --> 00:09:35.472
Merlin smiles.

00:09:35.532 --> 00:09:40.403
He moves his hand up to his mouth.

00:09:40.463 --> 00:09:47.064
"Wait!" Morfran cries. "Don't drink that!"
  
00:09:47.124 --> 00:09:54.509
But Merlin quickly puts the potion in his mouth.

00:09:54.569 --> 00:10:02.926
Suddenly, a magic white light comes from Merlin's head.

00:10:02.986 --> 00:10:12.584
Just then, Ceridwen comes out of the house with a bottle in her hand.

00:10:12.644 --> 00:10:18.956
She sees and understands everything.

00:10:19.016 --> 00:10:23.760
She looks angrily at Merlin.

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:39.400
"You must die for that!" she cries.
 
00:10:40.000 --> 00:11:01.400
Chapter Four. Merlin Runs Away.

00:11:01.500 --> 00:11:08.800
"Come here, boy!" the enchantress cries.
 
00:11:08.900 --> 00:11:13.540
"I need to run!" Merlin thinks.
 
00:11:13.600 --> 00:11:18.062
In his head, he sees a hare.

00:11:18.123 --> 00:11:24.486
Then, suddenly, he is a hare.

00:11:24.546 --> 00:11:27.737
"Aha!" He thinks.
 
00:11:27.797 --> 00:11:33.360
"So now I can change into different animals."

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:39.202
Merlin runs away into the forest.

00:11:39.262 --> 00:11:45.256
"I can easily run faster than Ceridwen now,"

00:11:45.315 --> 00:11:47.658
He thinks.

00:11:47.718 --> 00:11:55.402
But when he looks behind him, he sees a big dog.

00:11:55.462 --> 00:12:02.900
It is running after him, and its angry mouth is open.

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:11.700
"Oh, no!" he thinks. "Ceridwen can change into different animals, too."

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:18.470
Merlin moves quickly through the trees.

00:12:18.530 --> 00:12:23.500
But he can hear Ceridwen behind him.

00:12:23.560 --> 00:12:27.772
She is coming nearer.

00:12:27.832 --> 00:12:33.543
Just then, he arrives at a lake.

00:12:33.603 --> 00:12:38.646
"I need to be a fish," he thinks.

00:12:38.706 --> 00:12:45.000
Suddenly, he's a long, dark fish.

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:51.824
He moves fast through the cold water of the lake.

00:12:51.884 --> 00:12:56.868
"I'm all right now," he thinks.

00:12:56.928 --> 00:13:06.300
But when he looks back, an otter is coming through the water behind him.

00:13:06.400 --> 00:13:11.998
"Ceridwen's an otter now!" He thinks.
 
00:13:12.058 --> 00:13:23.118
So he changes into a little bird, and goes far up into the sky.

00:13:23.178 --> 00:13:30.622
But soon, he hears an angry cry behind him.

00:13:30.682 --> 00:13:36.697
Now, a big eagle is coming after him.

00:13:36.757 --> 00:13:42.461
"Ceridwen again!" Merlin thinks.
 
00:13:42.521 --> 00:13:48.856
He moves here and there in the sky,

00:13:48.916 --> 00:13:53.518
but he can't lose the eagle.

00:13:53.578 --> 00:14:02.630
Just then, Merlin sees a hunter far down in the forest,

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:06.721
and there's a sudden noise — "Whoosh!"

00:14:06.781 --> 00:14:12.200
An arrow hits Ceridwen.

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:18.715
She falls to the ground near her house.

00:14:18.775 --> 00:14:24.820
Morfran runs to her dead body.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:27.863
"Merlin, you demon!"

00:14:27.923 --> 00:14:30.454
He cries angrily.

00:14:30.514 --> 00:14:42.800
"One day you must die for this!"

00:14:44.000 --> 00:15:06.200
Chapter Five. King Vortigern's Castle. 

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:16.100
After some years, Princess Adhan — Merlin's mother — moves away to a convent.

00:15:16.200 --> 00:15:21.140
But Merlin stays in his father's castle.

00:15:21.200 --> 00:15:27.492
He reads books, and works on his magic powers.

00:15:27.552 --> 00:15:34.292
"I want to be the best magician in the kingdom," he says.

00:15:34.352 --> 00:15:41.242
At first, Merlin learns to change the weather.

00:15:41.302 --> 00:15:47.226
Next, he learns to see through walls.

00:15:47.286 --> 00:15:54.122
Then, he learns to look into the future.

00:15:54.182 --> 00:16:00.926
Morfran lives with his father in the forest.

00:16:00.986 --> 00:16:05.078
He often thinks about Merlin.

00:16:05.138 --> 00:16:11.741
"Perhaps I can kill him with one of my mother's old potions,"

00:16:11.801 --> 00:16:16.534
Morfran tells his friend Arwel.

00:16:16.594 --> 00:16:24.250
But the old potion bottles have nothing in them.

00:16:24.310 --> 00:16:27.542
— all but one.

00:16:27.602 --> 00:16:34.264
"And this potion doesn't kill people," Morfran says.
 
00:16:34.324 --> 00:16:38.315
"It makes ill people well again."

00:16:38.375 --> 00:16:42.496
"So give it to somebody important,"

00:16:42.556 --> 00:16:44.697
Arwel answers.

00:16:44.757 --> 00:16:49.232
"And pretend to be a magician."

00:16:49.292 --> 00:16:59.493
Soon after that, King Vortigern visits Wales after years of fighting.

00:16:59.554 --> 00:17:08.320
He has a new wife, Ronwen, but she is ill.
 
00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:12.602
Morfran hears about this.

00:17:12.662 --> 00:17:19.456
He goes to the king's men with the magic potion.

00:17:19.516 --> 00:17:25.458
Ronwen is well again after she drinks it.

00:17:25.517 --> 00:17:30.330
So Vortigern calls for Morfran.

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:36.764
"You can be my magician," The king says.
 
00:17:36.824 --> 00:17:41.626
Ronwen is happy in Wales.

00:17:41.686 --> 00:17:44.790
She wants to stay there.

00:17:44.850 --> 00:17:49.204
"Let's make a castle on this hill!"

00:17:49.264 --> 00:17:52.736
She tells Vortigern.

00:17:52.796 --> 00:17:58.637
Vortigern begins the new castle,

00:17:58.697 --> 00:18:09.050
but the walls fall down again and again.

00:18:09.110 --> 00:18:13.988
"Make a magic potion and stop this!"

00:18:14.048 --> 00:18:17.447
the king tells Morfran.

00:18:17.507 --> 00:18:23.344
"I need the blood of a boy without a father for that,"

00:18:23.404 --> 00:18:26.166
Morfran answers.

00:18:26.226 --> 00:18:31.352
"Now, the son of a demon lives near here.

00:18:31.412 --> 00:18:44.676
Give me some men, and I can bring him to you."

00:18:47.000 --> 00:19:08.920
Chapter Six. A True Magician.

00:19:09.000 --> 00:19:15.738
Vortigern's men bring Merlin to the hill.

00:19:15.798 --> 00:19:22.460
"Here's the demon's son!" Morfran tells Vortigern.
 
00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:24.242
"Kill him.

00:19:24.302 --> 00:19:30.025
I can make a potion with his blood, and put it on the ground.

00:19:30.085 --> 00:19:34.488
Then you can finish your castle."

00:19:34.548 --> 00:19:38.020
"Morfran's my enemy!

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:42.222
And he's wrong!" Merlin cries.
 
00:19:42.282 --> 00:19:46.276
"There are two dragons under the hill.

00:19:46.336 --> 00:19:49.809
I can see them through the ground."

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:57.644
"Dragons?" Vortigern asks. "Yes," Merlin cries.
  
00:19:57.704 --> 00:20:02.056
"A red dragon and a white dragon.

00:20:02.116 --> 00:20:07.368
When they fight, the walls fall down."

00:20:07.428 --> 00:20:12.706
The dragons hear Merlin's cries.

00:20:12.766 --> 00:20:21.700
and they come up angrily through the ground.

00:20:21.812 --> 00:20:28.384
They are fighting, and breathing fire and smoke.

00:20:28.444 --> 00:20:34.236
"I can stop them!" Morfran says.
 
00:20:34.297 --> 00:20:38.067
He pretends to do some magic.

00:20:38.128 --> 00:20:42.914
But he is not a true magician.

00:20:42.974 --> 00:20:52.900
The dragons breathe fire on Morfran, and kill him.

00:20:53.000 --> 00:20:58.222
Merlin quickly changes the weather.

00:20:58.282 --> 00:21:05.558
Suddenly, there's a wall of rain in front of the dragons.

00:21:05.618 --> 00:21:10.406
They move up into the sky.

00:21:10.466 --> 00:21:18.664
When the rain goes, the dragons are far away.

00:21:18.724 --> 00:21:26.347
"You're a true magician!" Vortigern cries.
 
00:21:26.407 --> 00:21:32.800
He finishes his castle and calls for Merlin.

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:39.400
"Tell me about the future!" the king says. 

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:45.308
Merlin closes his eyes.

00:21:45.368 --> 00:21:53.079
"You, Vortigern, die without any children," he answers.
 
00:21:53.139 --> 00:21:57.590
"Dark years of fighting come after that.

00:21:57.650 --> 00:22:03.361
Then I see a sword with magic light in it,

00:22:03.421 --> 00:22:10.660
a king with a wonderful castle, and his beautiful wife.

00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:14.539
I'm that king's magician."

00:22:14.600 --> 00:22:21.042
"Be my magician!" Vortigern cries.
 
00:22:21.102 --> 00:22:25.214
"No," Merlin answers.
 
00:22:25.274 --> 00:22:29.196
"I must work more on my magic.

00:22:29.256 --> 00:22:35.608
I must be ready when my king and my country need me."

00:22:35.668 --> 00:22:41.256
Then Merlin changes into a hare.

00:22:41.316 --> 00:22:59.000
and runs away into the forest.